# Instant Pot Vegetarian Quinoa Chili

Based on [https://showmetheyummy.com/instant-pot-vegetarian-chili-recipe/…](https://showmetheyummy.com/instant-pot-vegetarian-chili-recipe) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251128153859/https://showmetheyummy.com/instant-pot-vegetarian-chili-recipe))

{ rating="4" image="instant_pot_vegetarian_quinoa_chili.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Instant Pot

- [ ] 2 [green bell peppers]{ ing="green-bell-peppers" }, diced
- [ ] 1 medium [yellow onion]{ ing="yellow-onion" }, diced
- [ ] 1 [jalapeno]{ ing="jalapeno" }, minced
- [ ] 4 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 1.5 Tbsp [chili powder]{ ing="chili-powder" }
- [ ] 3/4 Tbsp [smoked paprika]{ ing="smoked-paprika" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [ground cumin]{ ing="ground-cumin" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 2.5 cups [low-sodium vegetable broth]{ ing="low-sodium-vegetable-broth" }
- [ ] 1 (8 oz) can [tomato sauce]{ ing="tomato-sauce" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [quinoa]{ ing="quinoa" }

### Post-Pressure

- [ ] 1 (15 oz) can [black beans]{ ing="black-beans" }, rinsed
- [ ] 1 (15 oz) can [kidney beans]{ ing="kidney-beans" }, rinsed
- [ ] 1 (15 oz) can [corn]{ ing="corn" }, rinsed

### Optional Toppings

- [ ] [avocado]{ ing="avocado" }
- [ ] [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }
- [ ] [green onions]{ ing="green-onions" }
- [ ] [lime juice]{ ing="lime-juice" }
- [ ] [sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" }
- [ ] [cheese]{ ing="cheese" }
- [ ] [tortilla chips]{ ing="tortilla-chips" }

## Recipe

1. Place [peppers]{ ing="green-bell-peppers" }, [onion]{ ing="yellow-onion" }, [jalapeno]{ ing="jalapeno" }, [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, spices, [broth]{ ing="low-sodium-vegetable-broth" }, [tomato sauce]{ ing="tomato-sauce" }, and [quinoa]{ ing="quinoa" } into the Instant Pot
1. Cook 8 min on high pressure
1. Turn Instant Pot off and quick release
1. Stir in [beans]{ ing="kidney-beans" } and [corn]{ ing="corn" }
1. Let thicken, uncovered for 5-10 minutes
